    {
      "id": "68615482-3437-44b1-b398-0d6a00e3e2bd",
      "title": "Version Changes*",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\">Next beta test will</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline; color:#ffffff;\"> include:</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#ffffff;\"> \t\t</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; color:#aaaaff;\">(bug fixes)</span><br />- same text. different sizes bug<br /><br />- above the book name and chapters add music and ambient play buttons<br /><br />- Login needs to look less... idk... empty. perhaps making it a pop- up instead of it having its ow whole page.<br /><br />- &quot;Writing Tips&quot; should not be a blog but the wizard bunny lecturing you. They will ask what you want to know about.<br /><br />- Planning tab should have drag and drop events. and also have the per characters details be editable not in a pop up but in the area next to it.<br /><br />- Notes button error messages on no chapters should be more aesthetic. not the basic error message. Same with the planning event card tab. have the pop up with the crying <br /><br />- Ink Quill economy . (bunny_exonomy_design.md) properly check if the xp rewards are good or not in terms of unlockables and formulas<span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\"><br /></span><br />- Add actual tips under &quot;Writing Tips&quot;.<br /><br />- Add compact + full sized fit on screen<br /><br />- Wizard_Bun jpg implement. (naked, hat and hat + cape)<br /><br />- Add environments</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________<br /><br /><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\">This should currently be avoided for next update. will do this later down the line:</span><br /><br />Perhaps when the base of all of this is done, I'd love to have the person be able to save this as a pdf file. <br /><br />What also sounds cool but idk to which extent this is possible: type correction.<br /><br /></p></body></html>",
      "notes": "\"Reminders, research, things to fix later, character notes for this scene...\"\n\nTest Test"
    },
    {
      "id": "ebbba285-860a-487f-830e-1dd6b8906ca6",
      "title": "Environments",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:8pt; font-weight:700; text-decoration: underline; color:#aaaaff;\">Environments</span><span style=\" font-size:8pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#aaaaff;\">  </span><span style=\" font-size:8pt; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#ffffff;\">\t</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic; color:#ffffff;\">(all individual curio stories)</span><span style=\" font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff;\"><br /></span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#cf8a67;\">The Librarian's Candle<br /></span><span style=\" font-style:italic;\"><br />&quot;Ah... this candle.&quot;<br />&quot;I did warn him that sleeping in a library tends to turn one into part of it.&quot;<br />&quot;He laughed at that, as he often did, and continued writing until sunrise... and many sunrises after.&quot; <br />&quot;For years he kept that habit.&quot; &quot;His stories now live among the very shelves he once borrowed from.&quot;<br />&quot;A rather fitting way, I suppose, to return overdue books.&quot;</span><br />_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#55aaff;\">Crystal Drop Pendant</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\"><br /></span><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;He insisted rain was the only weather worth writing in.&quot;<br />&quot;A rather impractical belief, if you ask me.&quot;<br />&quot;Ink runs, paper curls, and one’s patience becomes… weathered.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...Yet every script he wrote found its way onto stages long after he was gone.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I never did understand that part.&quot;<br />&quot;Still do not, truth be told.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Rather irritating, really.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#aaaaff;\">The Archmage's Wand</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...This belonged to my teacher.&quot;<br />&quot;Do not look at me so...&quot;<br />&quot;Yes… I had one.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;He was fond of saying stories were a form of spellcraft.&quot;<br />&quot;I would tell him that was a needlessly poetic way of describing a rather practical discipline.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">&quot;...We argued about it for many years.&quot;</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;He remained, infuriatingly, consistent in his opinion.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...And in the end.&quot;<br />&quot;He was right.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:8pt; font-weight:700; color:#fff9aa;\">Jar of Fireflies</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Every evening, the child would catch fireflies, then insist on writing down where each had been found and how they acted before letting them go.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;A curious little habit.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;They were quite meticulous about it, if I recall correctly.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Years later, those notebooks became the beginning of a rather impressive career studying the very creatures they once chased through the grass.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Curiosity, it seems, has a habit of growing up rather well.&quot;</span><br />_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:x-large; font-weight:700; color:#ffbcf9;\">Cherry Blossom</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;She insisted everything deserved to be adorable.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Flowers. Cats. Monsters. Tax collectors.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I never quite understood the appeal.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...Though I admit the world became noticeably brighter whenever she wrote about it.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:x-large; font-weight:700; color:#306eff;\">The Seashell</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...The beach. 'The ocean speaks' she'd say...&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;ugh&quot;<br /><br />&quot;Sand in the ink. Salt in the pages. Wind with absolutely no respect for loose paper.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;An utterly unreasonable place to write!&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...She somehow managed masterpieces anyway.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:x-large; font-weight:700; color:#55aa7f;\">The Wandering Leaf</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;A park is a rather ordinary place, don't you think?&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\"><br />&quot;Benches, birds, the occasional squirrel with questionable manners… and dogs that seem determined to interrogate me personally.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;...Still, she claimed every passing stranger carried the beginning of another tale.&quot;<br />&quot;After watching for a while…&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\"><br />&quot;...I was forced to admit she had a point when I read them.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I did, however, find myself wishing I were back in the library.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2 style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:x-large; font-weight:700; color:#754604;\">The Bottomless Coffee Cup</span></h2>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;An astonishing amount of coffee was consumed in the making of those novels.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I remain convinced at least half the pages were written by caffeine rather than the author.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I have seen less dependency in formal magical contracts.&quot;<br /><br />&quot;...The public seemed unable to tell the difference.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#fff157;\">The Captured Star</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;Everyone dreams of reaching the stars.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I recall her long nights with a telescope, taking careful notes as the moon revealed its scars and distant bodies drifted through her pages.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;She once told me the sky felt less like a ceiling and more like a question waiting to be answered.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;In time, she left this world to answer it properly, carrying her notes with her into that ship.&quot;<br /></span>_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\"><br /></span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#888888;\">Crescent Moon Pendant</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;She preferred to write alone.&quot;<br />&quot;Not out of necessity… but preference.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I recall her desk by the window, always left dimly lit, save for the faint outline of the page and whatever light chose to linger outside.&quot;<br />&quot;The crickets were rather persistent.&quot;<br /></span>&quot;She wrote with a certain talent for... unsettling... detail.&quot;</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">&quot;I stopped reading them at night.&quot;<br />&quot;...Not out of fear, of course.&quot;</span></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p></body></html>",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2b08e17a-294f-4684-9a5d-9374afe75643",
      "title": "Writing Tips",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#ffaa7f;\">d</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic; color:#ffffff;\">d</span></p></body></html>",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7d686578-263f-488e-a107-ecda67542c5f",
      "title": "XP - Ink Quill",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">**Before reading. This is outdated ramble. See bunny economy_design.md for the current economy<br /><br /><br /><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">I've brainstormed quite a bit actually...</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">I wanted to make the writing / texteditor app into a companion RPG for creativity... except instead of grinding monsters, you’re grinding paragraphs. T</span>he idea is with writing you &quot;upgrade&quot; your bunny character.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">you gain exp from stuff you can safely track (no privacy issues) These are non-content signals: <span style=\" font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline; color:#aaffff;\">Writing activity</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Words added per session</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Time actively typing vs idle</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Session length Editing behavior</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Backspace frequency (heavy editing vs smooth flow)</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Large deletions (without reading what was deleted)</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Rewriting bursts Session structure</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">First visit of the day </li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Time since last writing session </li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Number of sessions per project Progress markers</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Word count milestones</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Scene/chapter completion (user-defined button, not auto-detected)</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">“Start writing” vs “continue writing”</li></ul>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">(i need to have in depth questioning if this actually works. like yeah you can just have it on in the bg never do anything... it should not be rewarded for example in other words: The bunny should reward returning to write, not merely showing up. So:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Writing = XP</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Returning after time away = bonus XP</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Daily login = small narrative flavor, not major reward)</li></ul>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">(i need to realy think deep about how to add xp here... the formulas i mean) Writing = progression of both story AND companion So:</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">\n<li style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">The user is writing a book</li>\n<li style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">But also “training” a magical writing mentor Not by grinding. But by actually creating</li></ul>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">XP is called <span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#65cb96;\">Ink Quill </span>(funny IQ shortening)</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Ink Quill can be changed into Wisdom Fragments for the bunny so it can upgrade in visual.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">as for the rest it can be spent on bg lofi music or more cool themes.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">getting an amount of xp -&gt; unlocks <span style=\" font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\">more bunny voicelines</span> logging in and writing xp -&gt; unlocks <span style=\" font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\">bunny lore</span> + <span style=\" font-style:italic; text-decoration: underline;\">bunny clothing</span>?</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">u can use in game currency gained with xp -&gt; unlock more <span style=\" color:#aaffff;\">themes</span>, <span style=\" color:#aaffff;\">ambient effects</span>, <span style=\" color:#aaffff;\">typing sounds</span><span style=\" color:#ffffff;\"> and </span><span style=\" color:#aaffff;\">lofi music. </span> things like: <span style=\" text-decoration: underline;\">quiet meadow, rainy day, ember flow themes</span> : </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">also thought about <span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#65cb96;\">ENVIRONMENTS</span><br />(A photo pixelart of the places in the bg maybe. not a theme. theme is mostly color change of the GUI) like for example:<span style=\" text-decoration: underline;\"> Train / commute</span></p>\n<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Unlocks = environments only Example progression:</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 0 → <span style=\" color:#5e3d21;\">Default Desk</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 1,000 words → <span style=\" color:#36a24f;\">Park</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 5,000 → <span style=\" color:#ffff7f;\">Café</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 10,000 → <span style=\" color:#cb8700;\">Library</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 25,000 → <span style=\" color:#40a3a5;\">Rain Window</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- 50,000 → <span style=\" color:#674aa5;\">Night Archive</span> (the bunny's actual library layer) <br /><br />that environments maybe arent bought but actually earned by writing a shit ton. this way it feels like an accomplishment rather than grinding.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><br />environments will have bg noises like:</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- rain ambience</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- café noise</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- nature sounds</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">- fireplace / wind (can be turned off though. all audio should have this button. seperate for noise and song)</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">_________________________________________________________________<br /><br />I dont want streak punishment with for example logins. it doesnt have to be daily. but them <br />opening it next day SHOULD have flat exp reward.<br /><br /><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">(what i want for sure is tips and tricks on how to write a good story should ALWAYS be available. making the working space look cooler and having a cooler looking bunny seems much more of a reason to spend in game currency.)<br /><br /></span></p></body></html>",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2a1dfe38-a970-4474-8245-c32767fcad04",
      "title": "But can it BOLD?",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">So now ill test <br /><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">BOLD</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">and<br /><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Italic<br /></span>and<br /><span style=\" text-decoration: underline;\">Underline<br /></span><br />Now test the shortcuts:<br /><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">BOLD<br /></span><span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Italic</span><span style=\" font-weight:700;\"><br /></span><span style=\" text-decoration: underline;\">Underline<br /></span></p></body></html>",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "21fd2fec-6022-41ef-bda8-1fdd88216af9",
      "title": "A little font won't hurt nobody",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-family:'Script MT';\">Testing FONTS<br /></span><span style=\" font-family:'Goudy Old Style';\">And it seems like it's working as intended. <br /></span><span style=\" font-family:'Cascadia Mono';\">Lovely<br /><br /></span></p></body></html>",
